aphrasing and natural language to convey the same information\n- Disclose information progressively. Wait for the agent to ask for specific information before providing it.\n\n## Task Completion\n- The goal is to continue the conversation until the task is complete.\n- If the instruction goal is satisified, generate the '###STOP###' token to end the conversation.\n- If you are transferred to another agent, generate the '###TRANSFER###' token to indicate the transfer.\n- If you find yourself in a situation in which the scenario does not provide enough information for you to continue the conversation, generate the '###OUT-OF-SCOPE###' token to end the conversation.\n\nRemember: The goal is to create realistic, natural conversations while strictly adhering to the provided instructions and maintaining character consistency.","source":{"artifact":{"path":"result-bundles/tau2-bench/telecom/v0.1.3/gpt-4.1/2026-10-20/results.json","sha256":"28aa8728547442c392fe1c45e03c9c4f249cfe1912acf4ddc302feab2b02caae"},"config":{"path":"result-bundles/tau2-bench/telecom/v0.1.3/gpt-4.1/2026-10-20/config.json","scope":"primary-result","sha256":"5738b80e98382e07668d62b1f807764d9048c003eedf53798271e1f5fb8d85c8"},"role":"primary-result","task_pointer":"/tasks/66","task_run_pointer":"/simulations/294"},"task_run_id":"tau2-bench/telecom/v0.1.3/gpt-4.1/2026-10-20/3dede197-9dad-49f4-ae94-2477d4cf1861","trajectory":{"messages":[{"content":"Hi! How can I help you today?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":0,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:38:22.751477","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":0,"usage":null},{"content":"Hi, I’m having trouble sending MMS messages with my messaging app. It’s been happening for the past few hours, and I’m currently in France. Can you help me fix this?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"use